          title: 'Complete Banking System',
          code: 'import java.math.BigDecimal;\nimport java.util.*;\n\n// Record for immutable data\nrecord Account(String id, String holder, BigDecimal balance) {\n    Account { if (balance.compareTo(BigDecimal.ZERO) < 0) throw new IllegalArgumentException(); }\n}\n\n// Enum for fixed types\nenum TransactionType { DEPOSIT, WITHDRAWAL, TRANSFER }\n\n// Sealed class for restricted hierarchy\nsealed class AccountType permits Checking, Savings {}\nfinal class Checking extends AccountType { final BigDecimal overdraftLimit = new BigDecimal("500"); }\nfinal class Savings extends AccountType { final double interestRate = 0.05; }\n\n// Interface for contracts\ninterface Auditable { void log(String action); }\n\n// Main service\npublic class BankService implements Auditable {\n    private static int counter = 0;\n    private final List<Account> accounts = new ArrayList<>();\n\n    public Account createAccount(String holder, BigDecimal balance) {\n        Account acc = new Account("ACC-" + (++counter), holder, balance);\n        accounts.add(acc);\n        log("Created account: " + acc.id());\n        return acc;\n    }\n\n    public Optional<Account> findById(String id) {\n        return accounts.stream().filter(a -> a.id().equals(id)).findFirst();\n    }\n\n    public void processTransaction(Account acc, TransactionType type, BigDecimal amount) {\n        String result = switch (type) {\n            case DEPOSIT -> "Deposited " + amount;\n            case WITHDRAWAL -> "Withdrew " + amount;\n            case TRANSFER -> "Transferred " + amount;\n        };\n        log(acc.holder() + ": " + result);\n    }\n\n    @Override\n    public void log(String action) { System.out.println("[AUDIT] " + action); }\n\n    public static void main(String[] args) {\n        BankService bank = new BankService();\n        Account acc = bank.createAccount("Ahmed", new BigDecimal("1000"));\n        bank.processTransaction(acc, TransactionType.DEPOSIT, new BigDecimal("500"));\n        bank.findById(acc.id()).ifPresent(a ->\n            System.out.println("Balance: " + a.balance()));\n    }\n}',
